  "bio": "Alexis Vaatete, a California-based artist specialized in 'black&gray' and 'trashpolka' styles, has made a name for himself as a freehand artist in the tattoo industry. With an impressive following of well over 200,000 enthusiasts on Instagram, he operates out of Vatican Studios, which is nestled in the heart of Lake Forest, United States. An ardent art lover, Alexis embodies the title '#OwlKing' by creating intense, unique designs that are as mesmerizing as they come.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: Lake Forest, California, United States\n\nFreehand artist\n#OwlKing\nCali artist @vaticanstudios_oc",
